::  modules/apps/colloquium/glow/fold-colloquium-bill.glow -- Civic
/!  16384
|%
++  fold-civic-seva-split
  |=  [gross-mala=@ud seva-bps=@ud]                     ::  bps: 0..10000
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  transparent Seva
  ~|  'civic-bps-above-hundred-percent'                 ::  <= 100.00%
  ?>  (lte seva-bps 10000)                              ::  policy in .brix!
  (div (mul gross-mala seva-bps) 10000)                 ::  auditable share
--
